// ===================================================================
// Phoenix נפרעים export  —  PowerTerm PSL macro
// (PowerTerm WebConnect 5.8 — syntax verified against the bundled WebHelp)
// ===================================================================
// Runs INSIDE PowerTerm, so keystrokes go straight to the host — none of
// the Windows focus / scancode / Hebrew-mode problems that block external
// automation.
//
// From the host MAIN MENU it:
//   1. picks option 13  (הורדת קבצים ל-PC  → export form)
//   2. Enter  (accept the pre-filled form / selected row)
//   3. כ      (download the file → C:\fnxbox\)
//
// ── HOW TO RUN ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────
// In PowerTerm, find the script commands (under the menus / a Script
// submenu): "RunScript" → pick this file. Or bind it to a key with
// "key" so one press exports.
//
// ── EVEN SIMPLER / MOST RELIABLE: RECORD instead of this script ────
// PowerTerm WebConnect has a recorder that captures your exact keys
// (including כ in the right encoding):
//   1. StartScriptRecording
//   2. do the export yourself: 13 <Enter> <Enter> כ
//   3. StopScriptRecording  →  SaveRecordedScript
//   4. replay anytime with ActivateRecordedScript (or bind it to a key)
// Use the recorded script if the 'כ' below comes through wrong.
// ===================================================================

wait 1 seconds

// 1) main menu → option 13 → export form
send "13<enter>"
wait 2 seconds

// 2) accept the form / selected row
send "<enter>"
wait 1 seconds

// 3) download to PC
send "כ"
wait 3 seconds

// Done — file lands in C:\fnxbox\ (MU_NK_HAYV_MOSHE_<period>).
